   "offsets": {
    "from": 0,
    "to": 2660
   },
   "text": " Right, let's start with the boundary survey. Have we heard",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_1"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:02,660",
    "to": "00:00:04,260"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 2660,
    "to": 4260
   },
   "text": " back from the surveyor yet?",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_1"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:04,780",
    "to": "00:00:08,130"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 4780,
    "to": 8130
   },
   "text": " Not yet. I chased them on Tuesday, and they said the report",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_0"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:08,130",
    "to": "00:00:09,720"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 8130,
    "to": 9720
   },
   "text": " would land by Friday.",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_0"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:10,260",
    "to": "00:00:12,820"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 10260,
    "to": 12820
   },
   "text": " That's later than we told the client. We promised them a",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_1"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:12,820",
    "to": "00:00:14,120"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 12820,
    "to": 14120
   },
   "text": " decision this week.",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_1"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:14,560",
    "to": "00:00:17,460"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 14560,
    "to": 17460
   },
   "text": " I know. I think we should write to her today and explain",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_0"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:17,460",
    "to": "00:00:18,900"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 17460,
    "to": 18900
   },
   "text": " the delay honestly.",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_0"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:19,560",
    "to": "00:00:22,190"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 19560,
    "to": 22190
   },
   "text": " Agreed. Draft something short and make sure you mention the",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_1"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:22,190",
    "to": "00:00:22,900"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 22190,
    "to": 22900
   },
   "text": " new date.",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_1"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:23,040",
    "to": "00:00:26,520"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 23040,
    "to": 26520
   },
   "text": " Will do. Should I also flag the encroachment issue or wait",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_0"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:26,520",
    "to": "00:00:27,680"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 26520,
    "to": 27680
   },
   "text": " for the survey?",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_0"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:28,300",
    "to": "00:00:31,110"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 28300,
    "to": 31110
   },
   "text": " Wait for the survey. There's no point alarming her before",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_1"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:31,110",
    "to": "00:00:32,120"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 31110,
    "to": 32120
   },
   "text": " we have the facts.",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_1"
  },
  {
   "timestamps": {
    "from": "00:00:32,700",
    "to": "00:00:35,500"
   },
   "offsets": {
    "from": 32700,
    "to": 35500
   },
   "text": " Understood. I'll have a draft with you before lunch.",
   "speaker": "SPEAKER_0"
  }
